+
+
+### Bound native and remote Chat delivery
+
+The existing Core presentation owner returns one source-authored decision brief and the complete
+validated summary. A supported MCP UI uses `presentation_delivery.mode: native_plus_chat`: show the
+native card and forward its exact compact `presentation_delivery.text` once into the same private
+Chat, including the iPad route. Otherwise forward the complete `full_chat` text once. Never append
